CITY OF CHEYENNE
CONTRACT MODIFICATION

Contract Modification:
#1
Project:

Cheyenne Railcar Project, Bid Package No. 1, Asbestos and Lead
Paint Abatement Project.
Project Number:

250018, Contract # 8057
Contractor:

Orion Environmental Inc.
Date Prepared:

10/25/2024

The above referenced contract is amended or modified as set forth in the following and these
amendments and modifications of the plans and specifications are agreed to by the Parties. All other
aspects of the original agreement remain unchanged and in full force and effect.

I. Description of Changes

Removal of interiors of all four (4) railcars, including all lead, asbestos, and non-structural
components.  When this bid was released the railcars were intended to be used as either static
displays, or with the original interiors remaining.  After asbestos and lead abatement services
commenced under this bid, it was determined that the railcars needed further abatement in order to
allow the railcars to be used for a purpose other than a static display.

II. New Contract Items

Internal abatement of the caboose was not originally included, and this contract modification will
provide the funds need to complete that abatement.  Additionally, this contract modification
proposes additional abatement quantities for the other three (3) railcars that were not included in the
original bid. The Contractor’s proposal is included with this contract modification and attached an
incorporated herein as Exhibit A.

III. Schedule

Contract ends extend from December 6th to December 13th, 2024.

IV. Summary

Original Contract Amount .................................................................................$473,028.00
Previous Modifications .................................................................................................$0.00
Contract Amount Prior to this Modification ......................................................$473,028.00
This Modification ................................................................................................$91,846.00
New Contract Amount .......................................................................................$564,874.00

V. GL Account Information

If requesting a modification to the contract price, please list GL account # to cover the balance of
this modification (if using more than (1) GL account, list the dollar amount for each respective
account):

GL# 025-21-2111-40-46504   Amount: $91,846.00

1:31 pm, Oct 30 2024
